{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CH","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"歷代志上","commonName":"歷代志上","title":"歷代志上","order":13,"numberOfChapters":29,"sha256":"a668b4b6547e2ee24f3b6e74327236fef85ba56c9634c2dd8acf5b518e6a27b8","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":29,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CH/29.json","totalNumberOfVerses":939},"chapter":{"number":14,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["大衛在耶路撒冷的活動"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["泰爾王希蘭將香柏木運到大衛那裏，又差遣使者和石匠、木匠給大衛建造宮殿。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["大衛就知道耶和華堅立他作以色列王，又為自己的民以色列，使他的國興旺。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["大衛在耶路撒冷又立后妃，又生兒女。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["在耶路撒冷所生的眾子是沙母亞、朔罷、拿單、所羅門、"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["益轄、以利書亞、以法列、"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["挪迦、尼斐、雅非亞、"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["以利沙瑪、比利雅大、以利法列。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["戰勝非利士人"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["非利士人聽見大衛受膏作以色列眾人的王，非利士眾人就上來尋索大衛。大衛聽見，就出去迎敵。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["非利士人來了，布散在利乏音谷。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["大衛求問上帝，說：「我可以上去攻打非利士人嗎？你將他們交在我手裏嗎？」耶和華說：「你可以上去，我必將他們交在你手裏。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["非利士人來到巴力‧毗拉心，大衛在那裏殺敗他們。大衛說：「上帝藉我的手沖破敵人，如同水沖去一般」；因此稱那地方為巴力‧毗拉心。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["非利士人將神像撇在那裏，大衛吩咐人用火焚燒了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["非利士人又布散在利乏音谷。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["大衛又求問上帝。上帝說：「不要一直地上去，要轉到他們後頭，從桑林對面攻打他們。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["你聽見桑樹梢上有腳步的聲音，就要出戰，因為上帝已經在你前頭去攻打非利士人的軍隊。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["大衛就遵着上帝所吩咐的，攻打非利士人的軍隊，從基遍直到基色。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["於是大衛的名傳揚到列國，耶和華使列國都懼怕他。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CH/14.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CH/15.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CH/13.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}